      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-299007",
      ":question/problem": "A bookstore is restocking $35$ books onto three shelves:\n\n- Shelf $A$ holds $12$ books with fewer than $100$ pages each.\n- Shelf $B$ holds $11$ books with between $100$ and $300$ pages each (inclusive).\n- Shelf $C$ holds $12$ books with more than $300$ pages each.\n\nWhich of the following could be the median number of pages among the books?\n\n1. $90$ pages\n2. $150$ pages\n3. $320$ pages"
    },
