      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-299156",
      ":question/problem": "A city tracks the water usage of $31$ households:\n\n- Group $A$ includes $8$ households that used more than $400$ gallons of water.\n- Group $B$ includes $15$ households that used between $150$ and $400$ gallons (inclusive).\n- Group $C$ includes $8$ households that used less than $150$ gallons.\n\nWhich of the following could be the median water usage?\n\n1. $200$ gallons\n2. $300$ gallons\n3. $400$ gallons"
    }
